OL,3,GNEWSACancer trust 'changed course' of
OL,4,Amy life - survivor
OL,5,
OL,6,FA young woman supported by the Ellen
OL,7,FMacArthur Cancer Trust as a child has
OL,8,Ftold how the charity "changed the
OL,9,Fcourse of her life".
OL,11,FRosie Sanderson, 19, was a baby when
OL,12,Fshe was diagnosed with neuroblastoma, a
OL,13,Fcancer of the nervous system.
OL,15,FThe tumour on her spine left her with
OL,16,Fscoliosis and uneven leg growth,
OL,17,Fcausing ongoing pain.
OL,19,FSanderson said sailing trips for cancer
OL,20,Fsurvivors organised by the trust which
OL,21,Fshe enjoyed from the age of 12, were
OL,22,F"the highlight of her adolescence".
